The bottleneck is the symbolic BNF expansion at `t=4`, not the containment solve. I’m giving it one more interval, then I’ll run `t=1..3` and `t=4` separately with a more direct membership check.
diff --git a/box/bridgegate-20260903/bridgegate_build.py b/box/bridgegate-20260903/bridgegate_build.py
