+
+The page visibly has the same gauges
+`(f,g)->(f-(3/4)a_3, g-a_1 f-a_4)`, then displays
+
+```text
+f = h^3 + beta_2 h + beta_3
+g = h^4 + (4/3)(beta_2 h^2 + beta_3 h)
+    + (2/9)(beta_2^2+2 gamma) - (4/81)delta + a_2 h^2.
+```
