+```text
+-t(t+1)(20t*y - 3t + 10y - 2)/2,
+Res_y(H_t,num phi_5)=12*t^2*(t+1)^2*(2t+1)^4*(3t+2)*(4t+1).
+```
+
+Specialized primitive `H_t` data:
